+                    // with HANGUL JUNGSEONG O-U, if we computed both skeleta and compared them,
+                    // the skeleta would be HANGULJUNGSEONGO-E and HANGULJUNGSEONGOU, and the
+                    // comparison would fail on - vs. U.
